// Real-agent BasicSummon (the `find_familiar.ron` shape), scaled to three
// companions instead of one -- "scout, fetch, and relay" needs real agency
// (movement/perception), unlike a decorative phantasm that can't act on its
// own. Unlike `find_familiar.ron`'s permanent bond, this spell's own
// duration is `Concentration(60)`, so `summon_info.duration` is set to match
// rather than left `None`. `body: QuadrupedSmall(Squirrel)` stands in for
// "small animal shapes of their choosing" -- no in-cast body-selection UI
// exists, so one representative small-animal body covers all three.
//
// Same known gap as `find_familiar.ron`: `BasicSummon`'s `CreateNpcEvent`
// path never populates `comp::Pet`, so these familiars won't survive a
// logout/server-restart -- less load-bearing here since the spell is already
// temporary (60s concentration), but noted for consistency.
BasicSummon(
    buildup_duration: 1.0,
    cast_duration: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.4,
    summon_info: Npc(
        summoned_amount: 3,
        summon_distance: (1.0, 3.0),
        body: QuadrupedSmall((species: Squirrel, body_type: Female)),
        scale: None,
        has_health: true,
        use_npc_name: true,
        loadout_config: None,
        skillset_config: None,
        duration: Some((secs: 60, nanos: 0)),
    ),
)
